{
  "_comment": [
    "Row grouping per camera, listed front to back, each row ordered along the",
    "direction the row runs.",
    "",
    "Written by hand deliberately. Automatic grouping works on straight lots but",
    "fails on UFPR04, whose stalls fan out in a chevron so the arms overlap",
    "vertically, and it merges PUCPR's back-to-back rows because they touch. A",
    "real deployment configures a camera once at install; this is that step, and",
    "it takes two minutes per camera against a labelled frame.",
    "",
    "Cameras absent from this file fall back to automatic detection."
